---
const testimonials = [
  {
    text: `I just wanted to share a quick note and let you know that you guys do a really good job. I'm glad I decided to work with you. It's really great how easy your web ERP and customer HRMS sites are to update and manage. I never have any problem at all, getting regular update without bugs and affect other works also most important things getting regularly auto mix dashboard charts and reports.`,
    name: 'Tejan Agrawal',
    title: 'Director of Radhi Dairy Products',
    avatar: '',
  },
  {
    text: `We have started working with Shahastra Solutions since the COVID-19 pandemic to increase our business digitally. As many large companies also had sales losses during the pandemic. However, Shahastra Solutions's amazing products were become really very helpful for our business deals with old and new customers. We always feel proud that it was the best step to use the products of Shahastra Solutions during and after the pandemic.`,
    name: 'Gaurav Doshi',
    title: 'Director of Torgun',
    avatar: '',
  },
];
---

<section class="bg-[#F1F8FB] py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-orange-500" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" />
        </svg>
        Testimonials
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">
        What Our Clients Saying ?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We pride ourselves on providing an exceptional service to our clients, but you don't just have to take
        our word for it. Read what our clients have to say about working with us.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonial cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      {testimonials.map((t) => (
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 shadow-sm">
          <!-- Quote -->
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            {t.text}
          </p>
          <!-- Reviewer -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-gray-200 shrink-0">
              <img src={t.avatar} alt={t.name} class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 text-sm">{t.name}</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">{t.title}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center mt-10">
      <a
        href="https://www.google.com/maps"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-500 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors border border-orange-300 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-orange-50"
      >
        &rarr; Check Out Google Reviews
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
